<title>USA: Kings Mountain, N.C. won by First Union.</title>
<headline>Kings Mountain, N.C. won by First Union.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Union said it won $7.02 million of Kings Mountain, N.C., general obligation refunding bonds series 1996, with a true interest cost of 4.96 percent.</p>
</text>
